                                "example_id": "d834f148-975d-4378-bd3a-6ffba4a43a55",
                                "sense_id": "7b2016e2-f404-3629-b169-d7c7bf0a7cbc",
                                "text": "Standing in her entrance, two men in white silk suits and butterfly-looking lace bow ties, black instrument cases by their side and black-brimmed white hats in their hands–my father, Nestor Castillo, thin and broad-shouldered, and Uncle Cesar, thickset and immense."
